          model: `1. **Real results for local owners I'd be proud to know.** First, because it decides which clients I take. 2. **Clients I have are served before clients I'm chasing.** PMT's work happens before outreach every day. 3. **Clients hear the truth about the numbers, first and fast,** bad weeks included. **Never:** promise a number of customers I don't control, or take a client whose business I wouldn't send my own family to.`
