      title: "Griswold's Billion-Dollar Prank: the idea the establishment rejected",
      minutes: 6,
      tags: ["Book"],
      source: [{ doc: "Magical Worlds of the Wizard of Ads (Roy H. Williams, 2001)", section: "Chapter 89 · Griswold’s Billion-Dollar Prank · pp. 198–199", who: "Roy H. Williams" }],
