          model: `**Name:** PMT's beginner reel series becomes "Day One": simple, true for every student, and still fine in five years. **Encouragement:** to a PMT student who posted about passing: "You were white-knuckled Saturday morning and smooth by Sunday afternoon. That's the whole story of riding. Proud of you." **Restraint:** I won't post about the agency that burned a prospect before me; I'll just do better work for them.`
